Gershwin Eau theme
==================

url    = https://github.com/gershwin-desktop/gershwin-eau-theme.git
tag    = 26.09
commit = 3d741fbc61b62acb3dc1f3213ebe50a8a81c579c
date   = 2026-09-17

Built by tools/desktop/build-eau.sh, which foxyn-desktop(8) runs on the
desktop image (tools/linux/build.sh desktop): it downloads this revision's
archive, checks its SHA-256 and installs Eau.theme in
/System/Library/Themes (docs/desktop-eau.md). It is not part of
buildworld. Keep build output outside the submodule. When upgrading,
update the revision and checksum in build-eau.sh too.

License: LGPL 2.1 with other file-level terms; see LICENSE and source notices. These are source-tree notices, not a
completed file-level distribution audit. Check third-party code and assets,
preserve applicable notices and satisfy source obligations before shipping.

When upgrading, review GNUstep ABI, build order, compatible Gershwin
revisions, portability changes and license notices; run the desktop build
and runtime tests against the complete selected set.
